humidity or temperature was used as the training set, the algorithm still had a good MSE effect, and this was further proved by the commercial NO2 sensor. The excellent performance of the model was mainly due to the self-learning ability and self-adaptability of improved deep BP neural network compensation algorithm, as well as adequate training data. Combing with hardware implementation and software algorithms of sensor devices, it may provide effective technical solutions for the development and application of gas sensors with high accuracy in complex environments. It should be noted that: (1) According to the temperature background of agricultural greenhouse (~15–45 ◦C), we only investigated the gas sensing characteristics and compensation algorithm of the sensor at 10–50 ◦C. (2) During the preparation, the drying temperature of the PbS nanoparticles/NO2 sensor is 60 ◦C, and whether the PbS NO2 sensor can
withstand the working environment above 60 ◦C remains to be further explored. Therefore, it is necessary to further explore a wider working temperature and promote the development of gas sensors in other fields
